\n# Current Development Status\nFly Exterminator is currently in early access open-beta; we are aiming for a full release in December 2026. We plan to use early access to gather feedback, improve gameplay, and identify bugs before the full release.\n\n# How to Play\n* Use your hands to interact with and eliminate flies.\n* Move around your space to track targets.\n* React quickly as difficulty increases over time.\n* The goal is simple: eliminate as many flies as possible while maintaining control and awareness in MR.\n\n# More About Us\n* Boundary Interactive: https://boundaryinteractive.com\n* Discord: https://discord.gg/9hhGvvrBD2", "short_description": "A Mixed Reality game for the Quest 3 where you chase virtual flies that fly around and interact in your real room!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://boundaryinteractive.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Boundary Interactive LLC", "support_website_url": "https://discord.gg/9hhGvvrBD2", "website_url": "https://boundaryinteractive.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "28805257719106742"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622919_2193202178186023_878171098810592239_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_